   "title": "\u25b6 SHOT 1",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Shot 1, two and a half seconds. An empty family living room at night; he is the only person in the room. A lanky cartoon man with long wavy shoulder-length brown hair and a bushy handlebar moustache, in a dark v-neck t-shirt, sits alone on the sofa. The camera is beside the television at seated height, looking back at him; the television is out of frame and its light flickers on his face. He is mid-bite of a crisp. A woman (S2) says from off-screen, exasperated: <d>[English] Seth, dateline is in French again!</d> He stops chewing. He does not look into the lens."
   ],
   "color": "#232",
   "bgcolor": "#353"
  },
