   "title": "\u25b6 SHOT 3",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Cut. Shot 3, three seconds, the same closer angle on the man. Nobody speaks. The wince drains away and his face settles into flat, unimpressed annoyance. Then, slowly and deliberately, keeping his head still, he swivels his eyes all the way to the left and holds them there, glaring off past the edge of the frame. He does not look into the lens."
   ],
   "color": "#232",
   "bgcolor": "#353"
